      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Streamed HTTP vs WebSocket\n• token render vs frame batching\n• full Markdown vs staged parsing\n• pagination vs virtualization\n• optimistic UI vs reconciliation\n• flat path vs conversation tree",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Streamed HTTP vs WebSocket\n• token render vs frame batching\n• full Markdown vs staged parsing\n• pagination vs virtualization\n• optimistic UI vs reconciliation\n• flat path vs conversation tree",
      "autoResize": true,
